 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 532556,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You can buy a 9-inch diameter pizza for $10.99, or a 15-inch diameter pizza for $14.99. Which pizza is the better value?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Find the cost of one square inch of pizza for both pizzas. To do that, divide the cost of each pizza by the area of each pizza. The area of a circle with radius <i>r</i> is <span data-math=\"A = \\pi {r^2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>If the diameter is 9 inches, the radius is 4.5 inches.</p>\n<p>If the diameter is 15 inches, the radius is 7.5 inches.</p>\n<p>The area of a circle with radius <i>r</i> is <span data-math=\"A = \\pi {r^2}\"></span>.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th>9-inch Pizza</th>\n<th>15-inch Pizza</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Diameter</td>\n<td>9 inches</td>\n<td>15-inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Radius</td>\n<td>4.5 inches</td>\n<td>7.5 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Area</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\pi {\\left( {{\\text{4}}{\\text{.5 in}}} \\right)^2} \\approx 63.62{\\text{ i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\pi {\\left( {{\\text{7}}{\\text{.5 in}}} \\right)^2} \\approx 176.71{\\text{ i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cost</td>\n<td>$10.99</td>\n<td>$14.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cost per Square Inch</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{\\$ 10.99}}{{{\\text{63}}{\\text{.62 i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}}} \\approx \\frac{{\\$ 0.17}}{{{\\text{ i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{\\$ 14.99}}{{176.71{\\text{ i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}}} \\approx \\frac{{\\$ 0.08}}{{{\\text{ i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The 15-inch pizza is cheaper at roughly $0.08 per square inch compared to the smaller pizza at roughly $0.17 per square inch.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "the 15-inch pizza"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
